      <li><strong>Slow or inconsistent operation</strong> — takes forever to open, stops partway, or operates erratically</li>
      <li><strong>Frequent breakdowns</strong> — you've repaired it multiple times and it keeps failing</li>
      <li><strong>Missing safety features</strong> — older openers lack automatic reversal or photo eye sensors (dangerous)</li>
      <li><strong>You want smart features</strong> — remote access, app control, delivery notifications</li>
      <li><strong>Moving parts are worn out</strong> — gears stripped, chain/belt frayed, motor struggling</li>
      <li><strong>Remote range is terrible</strong> — you have to be right next to the garage for the remote to work</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="p-home" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
